  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home help for mothers and newborns in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will fund a part-time salary for an Albanian nurse for a year as well as an educational awareness campaign to help us reach more mothers. We will train the nurse to offer lactation help and teach our prenatal courses.   MamiCare is a project of the Mother and Child Hospital Foundation in Albania. We are focused on equipping mothers for birth and breastfeeding. We offer prenatal courses and home visits for lactation help.</narrative>
  </description>
